{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_49617","headline":"渔歌子 一 · 李珣","name":"渔歌子 一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"楚山青，湘水渌，春风澹荡看不足。\n草芊芊，花簇簇，渔艇櫂歌相续。\n信浮沈，无管束，钓回乘月归湾曲。\n酒盈尊，云满屋，不见人间荣辱。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李珣","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_49617.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_49617","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}